Package: gitmaster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lightweight and fast cross-platform Git GUI client
 GitMaster is a lightweight, fast GUI client for Git built using C++20,
 Qt6, and libgit2.
 .
 Key features include:
  - Repository management (init, clone, settings)
  - Branch, tag, worktree, and submodule management
  - Remote operations (fetch, pull, push)
  - Integrated unified diff viewer with inline character/word diffs
  - Visual commit history graph, stashing, blame, reflog, and conflict resolver
